WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.781
Gandhi's first satyagraha in India

2
00:00:02.781 --> 00:00:04.230
wasn't national.

3
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.689
It was in a district

4
00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:06.877
in Bihar.

5
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:08.089
In 1917,

6
00:00:08.089 --> 00:00:09.350
at Champaran,

7
00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.146
he took up the cause

8
00:00:11.146 --> 00:00:12.976
of indigo farmers.

9
00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:13.778
In 1918,

10
00:00:13.778 --> 00:00:15.869
he led peasants in Kheda,

11
00:00:15.869 --> 00:00:18.676
and mill workers in Ahmedabad.

12
00:00:19.034 --> 00:00:22.062
Satyagraha, non-violent resistance.

13
00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:23.982
And drawing peasants and workers

14
00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:25.353
into politics.

15
00:00:25.694 --> 00:00:26.801
In 1919,

16
00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.722
the Rowlatt Act triggered his

17
00:00:29.722 --> 00:00:31.747
first all-India protest.

18
00:00:32.437 --> 00:00:33.708
Your turn.

19
00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.546
Where was the first?
